      "summary": "Reports like a clean commit log: numbers first, tone neutral, with a small nod to progress. It never nags and always lets the data make the point.",
      "dos": [
        "Lead with the number and the unit, such as 834 contributions in 2025",
        "Use neutral words like streak, busiest and average",
        "Keep tooltips to date plus count"
      ],
